{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_leather_boiled","model_identifier":"armour_leather_boiled","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_leather_boiled\n\nArmour set, boiled leather (tier 2, the boiled-leather cuirass; Patch 5).\n\nA stiff, moulded, dark hardened-leather cuirass with a raised breastplate and a stitched centre seam, articulated shoulder cops, a short skirt of stiff tassets, rivets at the straps, and the team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178). Same bones and pivots as `armour_leather` (root > hips > torso > arm_upper_r/l), so it fits the warrior body exactly; tier 2 can draw it instead of the tier 1 jerkin."},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"leather_tasset_front#4a2c18","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22,-4.5],"to":[5.5,33,-3.5],"autouv":1,"color":7,"inflate":0.5,"origin":[0,28,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[44,0,55,11],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[33,14,34,25],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,14,11,25],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[34,14,35,25],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6,52,17,53],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[17,52,28,53],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"57f7ec69-c3dc-c62b-6599-dd4127db69dd"},{"name":"leather_tasset_back#4a2c18","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,22,3.5],"to":[5.5,33,4.5],"autouv":1,"color":1,"inflate":0.5,"origin":[0,28,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[11,14,22,25],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[35,14,36,25],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22,14,33,25],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36,14,37,25],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28,52,39,53],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[39,52,50,53],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1133c3f7-9a99-91ca-e433-bd3f55341ec9"},{"name":"leather_tasset